        <mxCell id="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-871" value="&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;4f22p-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;4f22p-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;4f22p-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;BGP NVA: &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9qgti-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;9qgti-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9qgti-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;1. Peers with both ARS&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dj8aa-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;dj8aa-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dj8aa-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;2. OS level it learns on-prem routes, all specific AVS routes.   UDR need NIC to route traffic to on-prem. On-prem via firewall NVA, 0/0 via f/w NVA&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;10h2s-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;10h2s-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;10h2s-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;3.  BGP NVA advertizes /22 (summary route) to ARS on left. Left ARS programs that into the VNET and gateway subnet with the next hop of BGP NVA. To overwrite that we need a /22 summary route in the gateway subnet - Must summarize&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;6cjn5-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;6cjn5-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;6cjn5-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bru5l-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;bru5l-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bru5l-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;4. Single NIC/Dual NIC design&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bmui4-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;bmui4-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bmui4-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;f9ol7-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;f9ol7-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;f9ol7-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;Single NIC: You have to use tunnel/VXLAN. NIC level UDR is not needed.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;303i8-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;303i8-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;303i8-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;bcr6h&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;ev7gq-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Aptos, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Helvetica Neue&amp;quot;, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;ev7gq-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;ev7gq-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Segoe Print&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;ink free&amp;quot;, InkFreeFont;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 45px;&quot;&gt;Dual NIC Design ( Each NIC peers with different ARS)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-869" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-6864" y="2745" width="1170" height="1105" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="BmDRo_5pf82-qyrZKwvf-621" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 80px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; AVS Network Design Considerations&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Brownfield/Azure/Hybrid/On-Prem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Hubspoke vs vWAN&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Multi-region&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; IP Address Planning (HCX - overlapping IPs with L2 Extenstion)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Routing vs Firewalling (Decouple)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;On-Prem - Firewalling, Load Balancing, NATing, VPN Termination (&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;All same device)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; i. VPN GW&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ii. NAT GW, AzFW&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;iii. EW and NS Firewall&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Azure Native Controls&amp;nbsp; vs NVA&amp;nbsp; (IaaS vs PaaS) AzFW vs NVA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;i. High Availability and Preserving Symmetry&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ii. Cloud Scalability&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;iii. Nerd Knobs/ Features&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;iiii Upgrades vs maintenance&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;iiii Skillset&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Flows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;i. Ingress and Egress&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;ii. East-West&amp;nbsp; (On-prem, inter spoke)and North South&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Ingress options (Regional vs Global,&amp;nbsp;Http vs https,L4 vs L7)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Egress Option (AzFW, NAT GW, Default SNAT, NSX)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;DNS/DHCP&amp;nbsp; Infrastructure&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; Varios DHCP options in NSX&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;DNS Best Practices&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Private DNS Zones&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 153);&quot;&gt;Secure Azure PaaS Access&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre;&quot;&gt;&#x9;&lt;/span&gt;Private Endpoints&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;HCX - Not part of this Session&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=60;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;labelBorderColor=none;html=1;" parent="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-869" vertex="1">
