        <mxCell id="kCLYUI6gs0_PMoNeYqfQ-631" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 70px;&quot;&gt;Option-4: Third Party NVAs in Hub-Spoke and ARS&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=40;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;labelBorderColor=none;sketch=1;fillStyle=solid;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontColor=#000000;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="7R4FPzORDA8CNPWVUaOo-638" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-975" y="-1417" width="2067" height="143" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="" link="https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/cloud-adoption-framework/scenarios/azure-vmware/example-architectures#third-party-firewall-solutions-in-a-hub-virtual-network-with-azure-route-server" id="gZh8-CRjNfK8WxdmE4t--672">
          <mxCell style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;fontSize=40;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="7R4FPzORDA8CNPWVUaOo-638" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry x="-3068" y="-2431" width="1993.97" height="1079" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
        <mxCell id="kCLYUI6gs0_PMoNeYqfQ-632" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="7R4FPzORDA8CNPWVUaOo-638" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="312" y="468.00000000000006" width="2473.05" height="1032.56" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-622" value="&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Option-4: NVA in Azure with ARS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;b&gt;Use case:&lt;/b&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;No Global Reach (ER to ER requires NVA + ARS) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Traffic inspection via NVA&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1b6ts&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bi3de-0-0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;bi3de-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bi3de-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;2. ARS + NVA, NVA Advertizes summary route 10/8 to attract all on-prem traffic towards ER. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bi3de-0-1&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(231, 18, 36);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Attract more traffic then needed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1b6ts&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;dtame-0-0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;dtame-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;dtame-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);&quot;&gt;3. Gateway Subnet Route table for AVS and Onprem segements (ARS will program the routes to go over the ER circuit)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;1b6ts&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;3nq12-0-0&quot; style=&quot;text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;3nq12-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;3nq12-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(231, 18, 36);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;4. User Defined routes per route table current limit is 400 Routes (Platform limit 10K)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(231, 18, 36);&quot;&gt;5. AzFW does not support route 0/0 advertizments or bgp&lt;/span&gt;.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;6. Considerations: NVA High Availability, NVA route back to itself&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;7. Expert Comments: Jason: Simulating what routing intent does in hub-spoke, HCX Mon Considerations (Host route from AVS to Azure /32 routes)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=79;strokeWidth=2;" parent="7R4FPzORDA8CNPWVUaOo-638" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-3541" y="2262" width="5421" height="1053" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <UserObject label="&lt;h4&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;" tags="" id="vY0A12Z6z95kiqLHBBsD-631">
          <mxCell style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;glass=0;fillStyle=solid;strokeWidth=5;disableMultiStroke=1;disableMultiStrokeFill=1;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;fontSize=50;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="7R4FPzORDA8CNPWVUaOo-638" vertex="1">
