        <mxCell id="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-626" value="Scenario: NVA in AVS (Simple Design)" parent="bhTP2_UY_HiaFr0e0wly-0" visible="0" />
        <mxCell id="124" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Scenario 3 Notes: NVA in AVS&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Use case: No 0/0 coming from on-prem or Azure, Use NSX for Inbound/Outbound, Inspection in AVS&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Notes:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cmcru-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Local Internet Connectivity using SNAT&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cmcru-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ensure that a default route is not advertised from on-premises or Azure as that will override this setup.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Note that ICMP (ping) is disabled by design; you cannot ping an Internet host.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(231, 18, 36); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;The Local SNAT service won&#39;t work when you have a default route from Azure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(231, 18, 36); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Local Internet using NSX (for Inbound and Outbound)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(231, 18, 36); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;NVA in AVS&amp;nbsp; (Licence/cost implications, 10 NIC Limitation)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;NSX Native Controls (Distributed firewall) is another option&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;DHCP (Three Options - Gateway DHCP, DHCP Relay, Segement DHCP)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Gateway DHCP requires it&#39;s own block.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;b&gt;Note: DHCP Option in AVS no auto registration of DNS for Linux&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;DNS:&amp;nbsp;&lt;b&gt;DNS&amp;nbsp; (DNS server in AVS or Custom DNS in Azure)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7kleb-0-0&quot; data-editor=&quot;1i1gk&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; font-size: 40px;&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7kleb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7kleb-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-0&quot; data-editor=&quot;1i1gk&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; font-size: 40px;&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(231, 18, 36); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; font-size: 40px;&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(231, 18, 36); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; font-size: 40px;&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(231, 18, 36); font-size: 40px;&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7l2lj-0-1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot; data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;sketch=1;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSize=40;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" parent="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-626" vertex="1">
