        <mxCell id="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-873" value="&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;faj3r&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;VXLAN NOtes:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;791fo-0-1&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Eencapsulation protocol such as VXLAN or IPsec is required between the NVAs. Encapsulation is needed because the NVA network adapter (NIC) would learn the routes from Azure Route Server with the NVA as the next hop and create a routing loop.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;faj3r&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;75hlu-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;75hlu-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;75hlu-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;faj3r&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;7av7q-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;7av7q-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;7av7q-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;faj3r&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;bp05h-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;bp05h-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;bp05h-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;OnPrem or the AVS routes will have the next hop of the NVA itself. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;faj3r&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;9jel0-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;9jel0-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;9jel0-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;&quot; data-block=&quot;true&quot; data-editor=&quot;faj3r&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;cokll-0-0&quot; style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 40px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;div data-offset-key=&quot;cokll-0-0&quot; class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; style=&quot;position: relative; direction: ltr; text-align: left; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;cokll-0-0&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Either you need NVA NIC level UDR or use VXLAN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=40;labelBackgroundColor=none;" parent="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-695" vertex="1">
