        <mxCell id="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-860" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Scenario - Secured vWAN with Routing Intent&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);&quot;&gt;Use case: Native Traffic inspection and no global reach&amp;nbsp;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Native vWAN security (EW and NS) Using Firewall Manager&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Enable in Maintenance window&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;AzFW advertize &lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;0/0&lt;/font&gt; to Branches&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Routing Intent is not support with Custom Route table (if exisiting custom route tables, migration planning required!)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(51, 255, 51);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Open a support case to enable&lt;/font&gt;&amp;nbsp;ER to ER transit using Routing Intent (No Global Reach)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);&quot;&gt;RFC1918 Routes get advertized to both on-prem and AVS for ER to ER transit, specific AVS routes get advertized over S2S Branch-AVS transit&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;Customers should not advertize RFC 1918 towards Azure because we adertize it from vWAN -&amp;gt; On-prem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=40;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;sketch=1;hachureGap=4;jiggle=2;curveFitting=1;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontColor=#000000;" parent="laxz53Nn7ZFMzm-YWPTC-808" vertex="1">
