        <mxCell id="VVfWL3hBqXmJXlwnSTHy-428" value="Scenario: Global Reach" visible="0" parent="VVfWL3hBqXmJXlwnSTHy-0" />
        <mxCell id="VVfWL3hBqXmJXlwnSTHy-429" value="&lt;font data-font-src=&quot;https://fonts.googleapis.com/css?family=Architects+Daughter&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Scenario Notes: Global Reach and ARS&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;Use Case:&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Use global reach,&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102); font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;No Azfw or NVA traffic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt; inspection in AVS or Azure VNET, Forced Tunneling via on-prem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;1. Routing:&amp;nbsp; ER to ER transit via global reach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;3 VPN ER Transit: Using ARS&amp;nbsp; (ARS not in the data path) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 40px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;Deploy ARS In a maintenance window&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;4. MSEE will pre-prend AVS prefixes (10.100 networks)learnt/recevied from Global Reach toward ER Gateway with 12076-12076-12076.&amp;nbsp; Spokes to AVS will prefer direct connection.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;5. MSEE will learn 10.1/16 and 10.2/16 (spoke routes) from ER gateway and global reach via DMSEE.&amp;nbsp; Flow from On-prem to Spoke will prefer the ER GW&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;because ER GW and MSEE have eBGP peering vs iBGP over global reach so eBGP learnt routes win&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 102);&quot;&gt;6. AVS Only Accepts dynamically&amp;nbsp;learnt route over Express Route. We cannot configure statiic routes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;7. HTTP /HTTPs Ingress via App GW (layer 7 proxy) vs LB Balnacer inbound not supported&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;8. AzFW to setup DNAT to a VM in AVS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 51);&quot;&gt;9. Forced tunneling does not apply to AVS /22 management networks. Remote sites could not access management networks (vcenter and NSX manager). Workaround -&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;to advertize more specific on-prem network for return traffic&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 40px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br style=&quot;font-size: 40px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;fontSize=40;" vertex="1" parent="VVfWL3hBqXmJXlwnSTHy-428">
          <mxGeometry x="-4407" y="1391" width="3419" height="884" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="VVfWL3hBqXmJXlwnSTHy-430" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 70px;&quot;&gt;Option-1: With Global Reach and ARS)&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;html=1;fontSize=40;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;labelBorderColor=none;sketch=1;fillStyle=solid;fontFamily=Architects Daughter;fontColor=#000000;fontSource=https%3A%2F%2Ffonts.googleapis.com%2Fcss%3Ffamily%3DArchitects%2BDaughter;" vertex="1" parent="VVfWL3hBqXmJXlwnSTHy-428">
